Maintainer: Your Name <your.email@example.com>
Description: Extends double score matching methodology to complex survey data
    for causal inference. Implements weighted double score matching (WDSM) 
    estimators for population average treatment effects (PATE) and population
    average treatment effects on the treated (PATT) under both prospective and
    retrospective sampling designs. Provides bootstrap variance estimation and
    maintains double robustness properties while properly incorporating survey
    weights. Based on the theoretical framework of weighted double score matching
    for survey observational data.
